{"synopsis":"Sebuah novel serial yang panjang tapi lambat The Great HumanDemon War\nBang GwangSuk membacanya berulang kali tergilagila dengan bangunan dunia yang megah dan perkembangan ceritanyA\nSuatu hari sebuah pesan misterius dikirim kepadanya\nCerita ini berakhir di sini\ngunakan kekuatanmu untuk menyelamatkan duniaku dari kehancuran\nSebelum dia bisa mendapatkan jawaban atas  Keanehan yang terjadi padanya sebuah dunia baru disajikan di depan matanya  dari sudut pandang Mad Emperor Exceltrion yang akan membawa dunia menuju kehancuran\nSial Aku telah menjadi sang Mad Emperor dari novel","alternative_title":"IBME","author":"Ryoo Seung Hyun","artist":"MARU COMICS","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"5b1196a3-2000-44a3-8867-99e3a5c3d150","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2024-11-24","released":"2024-11-24","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38c6dbe7-05ff-4081-a38d-d94817b87992/chapter_ch_45/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"792fc0cc-1d4a-4d20-9ea2-e48ebfb805b4","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2024-11-24","released":"2024-11-24","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/man